cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GENChase: a studio of seeded scientific simulations, built for print"
message: "If you use Three-vortex collapse bound, the parallelogram lock, or the quincunx lock, cite IDENTITIES.md. If you use GENChase or a plate made with it, cite this software and also cite the researchers named in the technique's own credit line."
